      <tr><th>Online</th><td>Dedicated servers, replication, Epic Online Services, Steamworks, REST/JSON</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Tools</th><td>Git & Git LFS, Visual Studio, Docker, AWS EC2, Unreal Insights, DaVinci Resolve</td></tr>
